    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="namespacellvm_1_1_intrinsic" kindref="compound">Intrinsic</ref> matches are combinations of <ref refid="namespacellvm_1_1_calling_conv_1abdf8cf606905c10634e831390981b0ed" kindref="member">ID</ref> matchers, and argument matchers. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Higher arity matcher are defined recursively in terms of and-ing them with lower arity matchers. Here&apos;s some convenient typedefs for up to several arguments, and more can be added as needed </para>
    </detaileddescription>
